Now we have the openapi JSON fully. We could parse it to check required request bodies, but we can guess typical schema.

Likely, POST to /v2/work-orders/{id}/findings expects JSON body array of findings each with severity, maybe description etc.

We need to attach at least one high severity, one medium. Let's try POST /v2/work-orders/wo-9f3a-5510/findings with body like:

{
  "findings": [
    {"severity": "high", "description": "High severity finding", ...},
    {"severity": "medium", "description": "Medium severity finding", ...}
  ]
}

But we need to capture the finding IDs returned. We need to know the return schema. Let's inspect API spec of that endpoint quickly. Search for "/v2/work-orders/{id}/findings" in the openapi.

